error[E0302]: field "or" of Rule is 'bool', found a list
  --> where_ops_reserved_field.bit:13:30
   |
13 |   let b: Where<Rule> = { or: [{ id: 1 }, { id: 2 }] }
   |                              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `or` is a field of Rule, so this key names the field and never a combinator; build the combinator with std/where: Where<Rule>(join = Join.Or, children = [...]) or Where<Rule>(not = true, children = [...])
